{"t":"Travelling","s":"travelling-f7e0f","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Warning Icon Red\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Some of these routes may be considered quest spoiling.</p><br/></div>\n<p>Fast transportation in Tibia is limited to players with Premium Account. The Free Accounts need to travel by foot, and of course the Premium only areas are unaccessible for them.<br/>There are two main forms of transport in Tibia, ships and <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">magic carpets</a>. Here are some maps and routes if you don't want to make an expensive trip but prefer to walk.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Routes\">Routes</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Rookgaard\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Level 1</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Areas\">Areas</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Demona</li>\n<li>Edron Bog Raider Cave</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AFemor%20Hills\">Femor Hills</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AHellgate\">Hellgate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AKazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AKazordoon%20Steamship\">Kazordoon Steamship</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AMintwallin\">Mintwallin</a></li>\n<li>Route:Isle of the Kings</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Intercity_Routes\">Intercity Routes</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossing%20Kha%27labal\">Crossing Kha'labal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Pass\">Kha'zeel Pass</a></li>\n<li>Mainland Trails</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum%20Passage\">Mount Sternum Passage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Thaian-Venorean%20Road\">Thaian-Venorean Road</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Bridge\">Astral Bridge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">Boat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\">Buddel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dog%20Sled\">Dog Sled</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">GCTS</a> (Gnomish Crystal Teleport System)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">Magic Carpet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nordic%20Tibia%20Ferries\">Nordic Tibia Ferries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ore%20Wagon\">Ore Wagon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope%20Ferries\">Port Hope Ferries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Turtle\">Turtle</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p>Cities, <a href=\"#/wiki/Femor%20Hills\">Femor Hills</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mintwallin\">Mintwallin</a></p></div></div>","quests":[]}